Copyright 2026 CenMag contributors

This product includes software developed as part of the FedSA-LoRA research
codebase (https://github.com/Pengxin-Guo/FedSA-LoRA), which is itself based on
FederatedScope (https://github.com/alibaba/FederatedScope).

CenMag-specific modifications implement center-residual magnitude ownership,
personalized state management, aggregation, checkpointing, and verification
for federated QDoRA. Upstream attribution notices in source files are retained.
